Step 1: Data Collection
Collect data sets for sugar consumption and health outcomes by country. You can use public datasets available on the internet.
Step 2: Data Preprocessing
Preprocess the data sets to remove any missing values and outliers. You can use libraries like Pandas to preprocess the data.
