Merge the sugar consumption and health outcomes data sets by country. You can use the Merge() function in Pandas to merge the data sets.
Step 4: Calculating Correlation
Calculate the correlation between sugar consumption and health outcomes for each country. You can use the corr() function in Pandas to calculate the correlation.
Step 5: Plotting Scatterplot
