4. Configure the Alexa Skill to use your AWS Lambda function as the endpoint.
To connect your Alexa Skill to your AWS Lambda function, you'll need to configure the endpoint in the Alexa Developer Console. This involves specifying the ARN (Amazon Resource Name) of your Lambda function and selecting the appropriate regions.
